{
"file": 108,
"paths": [
"d007/d003/f241"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "c9541741",
"en_raw": "Oh, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "604c7028",
"en_raw": "Another perfect pool day"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "af2391c7",
"en_raw": "You look like you have fun every day"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "35557501",
"en_raw": "It's fun, it's summer break!"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "e19bc61f",
"en_raw": "You've got to enjoy it!"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "082380e5",
"en_raw": "True"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "35c39b89",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "98e15482",
"en_raw": "about what you said before..."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "e6cbd5c4",
"en_raw": "Somehow, you seem down"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "98167780",
"en_raw": "Then I'll tell you something fun"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "cf7876a5",
"en_raw": "Know the portrait artist at the Wildflower Garden?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "c2f7a1ab",
"en_raw": "The 'I'm an artist' type"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "0af3bf96",
"en_raw": "you know"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "bf93f057",
"en_raw": "You're not going to say"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "3b29e45f",
"en_raw": "the guardian-spirit painter, right?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "c8a5443c",
"en_raw": "What, you know him?"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "c9f4fa11",
"en_raw": "Just heard about it"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "149a88a9",
"en_raw": "The dark-side gang living in this pool"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "a2e488e8",
"en_raw": "gave that painter's story fins on fins"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "63ab2338",
"en_raw": "and even legs and horns"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "24cf05da",
"en_raw": "get it at all"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "d37bba75",
"en_raw": "It's true it was fun"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "89a1ab75",
"en_raw": "It's not just a plain good drawing"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "d763130a",
"en_raw": "either"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "0a5059ff",
"en_raw": "Energetic kids are drawn in red"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "935d9e06",
"en_raw": "tired kids come out bluish"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "4508c087",
"en_raw": "When I went"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "9ea35f4e",
"en_raw": "in a giddy mood"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "5bfdb044",
"en_raw": "I got a red and orange portrait"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "5672ae1a",
"en_raw": "back"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "9d124bad",
"en_raw": "It was really fun"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "59d544cb",
"en_raw": "The atmosphere was"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "32ee7f6b",
"en_raw": "cool too"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "5aa7300f",
"en_raw": "Some juniors even became fans"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "23da1d4e",
"en_raw": "of his"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "02288c6d",
"en_raw": "Either way, a trendy story"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "4e2d5741",
"en_raw": "Being trendy is the fun part"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "845532c3",
"en_raw": "Hirauchi, you should"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "89c672f5",
"en_raw": "have one drawn too"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "e069102b",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Portrait Artist"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "40834246",
"en_raw": "By the way, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "e1546281",
"en_raw": "take me along on a dog walk"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "85a7a3c4",
"en_raw": "sometime"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "ce2962e2",
"en_raw": "I'll think about it"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "a70a8d18",
"en_raw": "Oh, Hirauchi"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "17fe3643",
"en_raw": "isn't interested in this kind of story"
}
]
}